<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Bridgecon 1996 net up 37 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Bridgecon 1996 net up 37 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	45.0    vs	33.0</p>
<p>    Net profit		   9.0    vs	 6.56</p>
<p>    Turnover		   369.30   vs     299.26</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    15.91   vs	10.46</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less   3.59   vs	nil</p>
<p>    Dividend   (pct)	  10.0    vs	 5.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Bridgecon Bhd. It is a civil engineering firm.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
